  <ym-title|Branch moments and trace washout: integration
  handoff><label|branch-moments-and-trace-washout-integration-handoff>

  Refs #34; Refs #26. Unit YM-000034.

  <section|Established local result><label|established-local-result>

  The section proves the three branch limits, the zero/zero/4O trace formulas
  and principal/false washout for each fixed natural exponent. It also
  derives conditional stronger trace rates from the displayed rooted-price
  and point-limit inputs.

  <section|Retained inputs and review status><label|retained-inputs-and-review-status>

  The precise upstream inputs and their source suppliers remain in the
  mathematical text and correspondence. Their complete quantitative
  production and the full existence argument are not asserted here. The unit
  is a draft with null formal review approvals. Agent assistance does not
  establish responsible human acceptance. Fresh pinned Lean elaboration and
  target-specific axiom/kernel replay remain unrun; source audit work is
  separately owned in #37.

  <section|Integration><label|integration>

  Match the same branch history and chart in Scribe and reconcile its
  duplicate branch sketch. Its curvature-square field O has expectation zero
  and is not the vacuum unit; the parent-owned wording requires
  clarification.

  The main assembly, supporting chapters, shared metadata, pinned Lean source
  and dependencies are unchanged by this contribution. Review the exact
  target version before integration. Actual local checks and their limits are
  recorded in validation.md.

